# Wave S4 evidence artifact (2026-08-27): the fitted-factors vs measured-binding-physics
# mode comparison. Tracked because it is the ONLY place the mode-vs-mode result exists,
# and a wave whose headline is "the fitted observability factors score worse out of sample
# than no factor at all" owes the reader the file that shows it, row by row.
# THE NAME IS LOAD-BEARING IN THE OPPOSITE DIRECTION TO WAVE S3's. `holdout_guard` check 4
# scans results/validation/*refit*.json / *rederivation*.json as FIT RECORDS and fails if
# one names a hold-out benchmark. This artifact names every hold-out benchmark and is NOT a
# fit record -- nothing in Wave S4 was fitted -- so it must NEVER be renamed to contain
# "refit" or "rederivation".
!results/validation/matrix_binding_mode_comparison.json
!results/validation/matrix_binding_mode_comparison.md

